  "citation": "Angell J K (2002): Global, Hemispheric, and Zonal Temperature Deviations Derived From a 63-Station Radiosonde Network. Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/CLI.005",
